1
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,260
(Leonard:)It's from Game of Thrones.

2
00:00:10,427 --> 00:00:13,097
(Leonard:)- What do you think?
- I don't know.

3
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:15,853
(Sheldon:)If we're going to start
a fantasy sword collection...

4
00:00:16,016 --> 00:00:17,686
And l've long thought we should.

5
00:00:19,144 --> 00:00:21,184
(Sheldon:)...is this really the sword to start with?

6
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:22,984
(Leonard:)What did you have in mind?

7
00:00:23,148 --> 00:00:27,238
(Sheldon:)Well, off the top of my head,
I'd have to go with Excalibur.

8
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:29,992
(Sheldon:)It gives you the right to rule England.

9
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,780
(Leonard:)It would be a replica of a movie prop.

10
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:34,907
(Sheldon:)Fair enough.

11
00:00:35,076 --> 00:00:38,456
It would give you the right
to rule a replica of England.

12
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:42,836
(Leonard:)Well, they don't have an Excalibur here,
so, what do you want to do?

13
00:00:43,001 --> 00:00:45,131
Ugh, tough decision.

14
00:00:45,503 --> 00:00:47,673
(Sheldon:)There's no weaponry
from Lord of the Rings...

15
00:00:47,839 --> 00:00:50,339
(Sheldon:)...forged in a Chinese sweatshop?

16
00:00:51,676 --> 00:00:54,306
Mm-hm, just Bilbo Baggins'
sword over there.

17
00:00:54,804 --> 00:00:58,684
(Sheldon:)Two grown men with a hobbit's dagger,
wouldn't we look silly?

18
00:01:00,894 --> 00:01:02,684
(Sheldon:)- Okay, let's go for it.
Heh.

